R1.1.0  13-May-2025  A. Le (anle)
    Improve accuracy of reply times
    Initialize bestReplyMsec to worst possible value
    Cache SNMPv3 engineID to reduce network load
    Implement priority polling after set operations
    Process PVs with PINI=YES as soon as data is received
    Allow poll period longer than 10 seconds and prevent record 
    init function from overriding it
    Replace 0xFFFFFFFFul with ULONG_MAX for compatibility
    and correctness

